                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The terms active and passive are ambiguous, however, because they can refer not only to those two grammatical constructions but also to how a sentence makes you feel. Compare these two sentences:",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                746,
                772,
                822
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 12,
            "global_block_id": 12,
            "global_group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    746.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    746.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    822.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    822.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We can manage the problem if we control costs.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                836,
                487,
                859
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 13,
            "global_block_id": 13,
            "global_group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    114.0,
                    836.0
                ],
                [
                    487.0,
                    836.0
                ],
                [
                    487.0,
                    859.0
                ],
                [
                    114.0,
                    859.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Problem management requires cost control.",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                877,
                456,
                901
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 14,
            "global_block_id": 14,
            "global_group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    115.0,
                    877.0
                ],
                [
                    456.0,
                    877.0
                ],
                [
                    456.0,
                    901.0
                ],
                [
                    115.0,
                    901.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Grammatically, both sentences are in the active voice, but the second feels flat or passive for three reasons:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                918,
                772,
                969
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 15,
            "global_block_id": 15,
            "global_group_id": 15,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    918.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    918.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    969.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    969.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• Neither of its actions—management and control—are verbs; both are nominalizations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                983,
                772,
                1032
            ],
            "block_id": 16,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 16,
            "global_block_id": 16,
            "global_group_id": 16,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    983.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    983.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1032.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    1032.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• The subject is problem management, an abstraction.",
            "block_bbox": [
                118,
                1041,
                557,
                1064
            ],
            "block_id": 17,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 17,
            "global_block_id": 17,
            "global_group_id": 17,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    118.0,
                    1041.0
                ],
                [
                    557.0,
                    1041.0
                ],
                [
                    557.0,
                    1064.0
                ],
                [
                    118.0,
                    1064.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• The sentence lacks flesh-and-blood characters.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                1073,
                531,
                1096
            ],
            "block_id": 18,
            "block_order": 15,
            "group_id": 18,
            "global_block_id": 18,
            "global_group_id": 18,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    1073.0
                ],
                [
                    531.0,
                    1073.0
                ],
                [
                    531.0,
                    1096.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    1096.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To understand why we respond to those two sentences as we do, we have to keep these meanings distinct. In what follows, we discuss grammatical passives.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                1111,
                772,
                1187
